    narr:narration """This hub maintains the [core product differentiator](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) of capturing decision artifacts at the moment of consensus, a framing established in March 2026. By late July 2026, the focus shifted toward [sprint delivery accounting](narr:Position_SprintDeliveryAccounting), moving from abstract value propositions to concrete operational milestones. The team reported the [shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785148834287_1) as a primary output, while identifying the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785148834287_3) as the essential technical catalyst for this capability. Concurrently, the team has begun [quantifying sprint velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785148834287_2) as a proxy for success, grounding the narrative in measurable delivery cycles.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785148834287_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785148834287_2> ;
